From 8fa36cdf35aacdcfa8ab5a8835a8913abcbddf31 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FunnyAWM <1142978300@qq.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:18:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] test(windows): clear 58 host-portability failures from the
 T-16 sweep

Root-cause pass over the 65 failures + 1 collection error recorded in
evidence/t16-scoped.log. Real defects: GBK-decoded child stderr crashed
_readerthread (now explicit utf-8/replace everywhere), CRLF leaked into
requirement outputs and made a clean Windows checkout unbundle-able,
os.utime(follow_symlinks=False) has no Windows support, npm resolves as
npm.CMD, and the Windows default home is %LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes.
Host capabilities a test cannot synthesize (pty, pip's distlib, pwsh,
symlink privilege, an incomplete host Python) now skip with a fixed
reason via tests/preconditions.py instead of failing opaque.
